---
import { skills } from '@/data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 · About</p>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="section-title">
        The short version.
      </h2>
      <div class="about__text">
        <p>
          Hey there, I’m Guido. I build full-stack web and mobile apps, but my real specialty is
          making sure no one makes them crash right before the demo. These days that instinct is my
          job: I read other teams’ codebases, find what will break, and explain it in terms a
          founder can act on.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started in hardware. I built school automation and smart waste-monitoring devices in
          Arequipa, and led the team that won the RoboCup Junior Soccer world championship in 2017.
          Then I spent over four years at RAVN, where I grew from trainee to software engineer, led
          teams of 2 to 10 developers, and cut onboarding for new hires from three months to one.
        </p>
        <p>
          I work in Spanish and English, with intermediate-advanced French, remotely with teams in
          the US and Europe. When I’m not doing any of that, I’m occasionally using my free time to
          compose the next summer hit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="skills" aria-label="Skills">
      <div>
        <h3>I ship with</h3>
        <ul class="tags">
          {skills.ship.map(s => (
            <li>{s}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>I review and audit</h3>
        <ul class="tags tags--quiet">
          {skills.review.map(s => (
            <li>{s}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="skills__note">
          Languages I read and reason about in client audits, alongside everything in the list
          above.
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  .about__text {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    align-self: end;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fz-xs);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tags--quiet li {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .skills__note {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: var(--fz-xs);
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
